OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire reacts as mayors get
OL,4,Atourist tax powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners in Yorkshire have said
OL,7,Fany "tourist tax" introduced under new
OL,8,Fpowers for mayors must be set at a
OL,9,Freasonable cost to avoid putting off
OL,10,Fvisitors.
OL,12,FRegional mayors in England are set to
OL,13,Fgain powers to impose an uncapped levy
OL,14,Fin their areas.
OL,16,FThe overnight charge would be paid as a
OL,17,Fpercentage of the cost of staying in
OL,18,Fhotels, bed and breakfasts and other
OL,19,Ftypes of accommodation.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
