OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire reacts as mayors get
OL,4,Atourist tax powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of pounds could be raised
OL,7,Fthrough the policy, which leaders are
OL,8,Fsuggesting could be ring-fenced for
OL,9,Ftourism-related purposes, but others
OL,10,Ffear it could deter visitors.
